\p
\v 1 \add ≈However\add* \add around then,\add* there was a \add ≈widespread complaint from\add* the¦223579 people¦223579 and¦223580 their¦223580 wives¦223580 against¦223582 \add ≈what their¦223584 fellow Jews¦223585 were doing\add*.
\v 2 \add ≈Some of them complained\add*, “\add ≈There's¦223587 a lot of¦223590 us when we include\add* our¦223590 sons¦223590 and¦223591 daughters¦223591. \add ≈We¦223592 need\add* grain¦223595 so¦223596 we¦223596 can eat¦223596 and¦223597 \add ≈stay alive¦223597\add*.”
