\v 4 \add ≈Yet others\add* said¦223613, “We've¦223614 borrowed¦223614 silver \add to pay the tax\add* on our¦223618 fields¦223618 and¦223619 our¦223619 vineyards¦223619 \add ≈that goes to the¦223616 tribute¦223616 to be paid to\add* the¦223617 \add foreign\add* king¦223617.
\v 5 \add ≈We're Jews just like¦223622 our¦223623 countrymen¦223623, but¦223627 we're¦223628 having to¦223629 commit our children into¦223636 bondage as slaves¦223636—yes, even\add* our¦223638 daughters¦223638. \add ≈Now¦223621 we own nothing at all—not¦223640 even\add* our¦223642 fields¦223643 and¦223644 vineyards¦223644.
