\v 6 I \add ≈got very¦223649 angry\add* when I¦223651 heard¦223651 their¦223654 \add ≈complaints and¦223655 desperation\add*,
\v 7 and¦223659 \add ≈I couldn't get it out of my mind¦223660\add*. I¦223662 \add ≈protested\add* to the¦223665 nobles¦223665 and¦223666 the¦223668 officials¦223668, “You guys are \add ≈charging interest¦223671 against your own countrymen\add*.”\x + \xo 5:7: \xt Exo 22:25; Lev 25:35-37; Deu 23:19-20.\x*
\p \add ≈So¦223681 I¦223681 called for a gathering¦223683 of all the people to deal with\add* them¦223682,
\v 8 and¦223686 I¦223686 told¦223686 them¦223687, “Our¦223692 brothers, the¦223693 Jews¦223693, were sold¦223694 to¦223695 \add other\add* countries¦223695 \add as slaves\add* \add ≈and we've¦223689 done all we can to¦223696 bring them back here\add*. But¦223698 now even you yourselves are buying¦223689 and selling¦223701 your¦223704 own countrymen \add to make a profit\add*.” They¦223705 \add ≈couldn't argue against that, so¦223708 they¦223708 were¦223708 just\add* silent¦223708.
\p
\v 9 “It's not¦223718 good¦223720 what you're¦223724 doing¦223725,” I \add ≈continued¦223714\add*. “Shouldn't¦223726 you all \add ≈respect¦223727 and obey\add* our¦223728 god¦223728, because \add ≈otherwise we'll be¦223729 despised by the other\add* nations¦223731, our¦223732 enemies¦223732.
\v 10 I¦223736 myself have lent¦223739 them¦223740 money¦223741 and¦223742 grain¦223742, as have my¦223737 brothers¦223737 and¦223738 my¦223738 young men, \add but\add* please¦223745 let's¦223743 forgo charging interest¦223748.
\v 11 Please¦223752, even today, return¦223751 their fields¦223755 to¦223753 them¦223753, and their¦223755 vineyards¦223756 and olive¦223757 orchards, their¦223758 houses¦223758, and¦223759 \add ≈the interest on\add* the¦223760 money¦223760 and¦223761 the¦223761 grain¦223761, the¦223762 new¦223762 wine¦223762, and¦223763 the¦223763 oil¦223763 that¦223764 you¦223765 are¦223766 charging against them¦223767.”
\p
\v 12 “\add ≈Okay, we'll do what you're asking\add*,” they¦223769 \add ≈responded¦223769\add*. “We'll¦223770 return¦223770 \add >their property\add* and¦223771 we \add ≈won't¦223772 impose any more charges on\add* them.”
