\v 15 The¦223858 governors¦223858 who¦223860 preceded me had been very \add ≈hard¦223863\add* on¦223864 the¦223866 people¦223866—\add ≈demanding\add* bread¦223869 and¦223870 wine¦223870 and forty¦223875 silver¦223872 coins. Even their¦223877 servants¦223877 \add ≈oppressed\add* the¦223881 people¦223881. \add In contrast,\add* I¦223882 didn't¦223883 do¦223885 that \add ≈due to desire to honour¦223888\add* God¦223889.
