\v 6 “These¦224434 are¦224436 the¦224436 descendants¦224436 of \add ≈the people exiled¦224440 by the¦224444 Babylonian King¦224444 Nevukadnetstsar, who¦224438 returned¦224446 to¦224447 Yehudah¦224448 and¦224448 to¦224448 Yerushalem¦224447—each¦224449 family returning to¦224450 their own¦224450 ancestral town¦224450\add*.
\v 7 \add ≈Their leaders were\add* Zerubavel¦224455, Yeshua¦224456, Nehemyah¦224457, Azaryah¦224458, Raamyah¦224459, Nahamani¦224460, Mareddekai, Bilshan¦224462, Misperet¦224463, Bigvai¦224464, Nehum¦224465, and Baanah¦224466.
