\v 65 The¦225016 governor¦225016 \add ≈had disallowed them¦225017 from eating¦225021 the priests' food\add* until¦225024 a \add recognised\add* priest¦225026 \add ≈could consult\add* the Urim¦225027 and¦225028 Thummim¦225028.\x + \xo 7:65: \xt Exo 28:30; Deu 33:8.\x*
