\v 4 \add ≈Prior to that¦227973 time,\add* the¦227975 high priest¦227975 Elyashiv¦227974 (closely related to¦227982 Toviyah¦227982) had been¦227976 \add ≈in charge¦227976 of¦227977\add* the¦227978 \add ≈temple¦227978 storerooms¦227977\add*
