\v 6 \add ≈During all¦228008 that¦228010 period,\add* I¦228012 hadn't been¦228012 in¦228013 Yerushalem¦228013 because¦228014 I'd¦228022 returned¦228022 to¦228023 the¦228025 Babylonian king¦228025 in the¦228026 32nd year¦228015 of¦228026 Artahshashta's¦228018 reign \add !(Artaxerxes)\add*. \add ≈However, after a while\add* I¦228028 requested¦228028 leave¦228028 \add again\add* from¦228029 the¦228031 king¦228031
\v 7 and¦228033 I¦228033 came¦228033 \add back\add* to¦228034 Yerushalem¦228034. \add It was then that\add* \add ≈I¦228035 discovered¦228035 how\add* evil Elyashiv¦228039 had¦228038 been by making a storeroom for¦228040 Toviyah¦228040 in¦228044 the¦228044 courtyards¦228044 of¦228044 God's residence.
