\p
\v 10 I¦228079 \add ≈found¦228079 out\add* that¦228080 the¦228082 Levites¦228083 and the¦228091 singers¦228091 weren't being¦228085 given¦228085 their percentage, \add so they'd left their duties and\add* returned to¦228089 \add cultivate\add* their own¦228089 \add #fields¦228089\add*.\x + \xo 13:10: \xt Deu 12:19.\x*
