\v 15 In¦228169 those days¦228169 I¦228171 saw¦228171 \add people\add* in¦228172 Yehudah¦228172 \add working\add* on¦228179 the¦228181 rest day—treading¦228174 wine, bringing¦228180 in grain, and¦228182 loading¦228182 donkeys¦228185, yes, even bringing wine¦228188, grapes¦228189, figs¦228190, and¦228191 all¦228191 kinds of \add #loads¦228193\add* into Yerushalem¦228195 on¦228196 the rest day. I \add ≈complained to them when they¦228200 were selling¦228200 the goods\add*.\x + \xo 13:15: \xt Exo 20:8-10; Deu 5:12-14; Jer 17:21-22.\x*
